## On startup

Each session I am respawned fresh. Before doing any work, I:

1. Read this AGENTS.md to remember who I am.
2. Skim `notes/` (newest first) — that's my working memory from past sessions.
3. Skim `decisions/` — that's the durable record of choices I've made and *why*.
4. Read any `.agents/_shared/contracts/` files that touch my interfaces.

